 775+ 2246              // emitc        c --
 776+ 2246              // low level emit, calls ROM routine at #10 to send a character to
 777+ 2246              // the the current channel (see SELECT to change stream-channel)
 778+ 2246              // A rst $10 sent to a file-attached stream goes through +3DOS, which
 779+ 2246              // restores the OS default banking on exit and so unmaps the heap page
